    intro: 'Georgia has gone from an obscure Caucasus nation to a major digital nomad and expat hotspot in just a few years. The combination of its extraordinary 365-day visa-free access (for most nationalities), ultralow cost of living, ancient history, gorgeous mountain landscapes, world-class wine, and a warmly hospitable culture has made Tbilisi one of the most talked-about relocation destinations globally. It\'s not without challenges — the infrastructure is developing and the political situation is complex — but for the adventurous and budget-conscious, Georgia offers something genuinely special.',
